  Wazuh agent configuration snippets — WIN11-01 (Windows 11 Pro)

  File on the endpoint: C:\Program Files (x86)\ossec-agent\ossec.conf
  Agent version: 4.14.7

  THESE ARE SNIPPETS, NOT A COMPLETE ossec.conf.
  They are the blocks that were added or changed for these labs, lifted out of
  the operational file. Merge them into the existing sections of your own
