  Addresses are placeholders: <WAZUH_SERVER_IP>.

  Restart the agent after any change. Restart-Service WazuhSvc frequently
  fails with "cannot be stopped" on Windows; use:
      net stop wazuh
      net start wazuh

  Then confirm the agent actually PARSED the change — present in the file and
  loaded into the running agent are two different claims:
      Get-Content "C:\Program Files (x86)\ossec-agent\ossec.log" -Tail 100
